        },
        {
          "text": " Elisha akasema, Kama BWANA aishivyo, na roho yako iishivyo, sitakuacha, Basi wakashuka mpaka Betheli. Basi wana wa manabii, waliokuwako Betheli, wakatoka kuonana na Elisha, wakamwambia, Je! Unajua ya kuwa BWANA atamwondoa bwana wako leo, asiwe mkubwa wako? Akasema, Naam, najua; nyamazeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya akamwambia, Tafadhali, kaa hapa, Elisha; maana BWANA amenituma niende mpaka Yeriko. Akasema, Kama BWANA aishivyo, na roho yako iishivyo, sitakuacha. Nao wakafika Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi wana wa manabii, waliokuwako Yeriko, wakamkaribia Elisha, wakamwambia, Je! Unajua ya kuwa BWANA atamwondoa bwana wako leo, asiwe mkubwa wako? Akajibu, Naam, najua, nyamazeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya akamwambia, Tafadhali kaa hapa; maana BWANA amenituma niende mpaka Yordani. Akasema, Kama BWANA aishivyo, na roho yako iishivyo, sitakuacha. Wakaendelea mbele wote wawili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
