        {
          "text": " Akatoka akaenda mpaka chemchemi ya maji, akatupa ile chumvi humo ndani, akasema, BWANA asema hivi, Nimeyaponya maji haya; hakutatoka huko tena kufa wala kuzaa mapooza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
